						  <section class="ourStorySec">
                <div class="container">
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="ContentText text-center m-0-auto Lodha Worli (Residential)">
                            
							                            <img src="/sites/default/files/projects/logo/Lodha-Logo.svg" alt="Lodha Asrina"
                                class="img-fluid m-0-auto logo_pro" data-aos="fade-up" loading="lazy" width="300" height="100%">
								
                            <p data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100" class="mt-1 aos-init aos-animate">
                                <p>Created with a bold vision and designed to hold value for generations, Lodha Worli brings together expansive landscaped greens and amenities where exceptional connectivity meets a rare oasis of calm, reserved for a select few.</p>
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
			  
			  <div class="row textImgGrid evenRow">
    <div class="textImgDiv d-flex justify-content-between align-item-center">
        <div class="imgDiv">
            <picture>
                
				<source media="(min-width:767px)" srcset="/sites/default/files/2026-02/2588625822_Lodha%20Worli_Images%20resize_527X468%20USP-21.jpg" alt="Lodha Worli - Residential Property In Worli with Perfect Location" title="Lodha Worli - Perfect Location">
                <img src="/sites/default/files/2026-02/2588625822_Lodha%20Worli_Images%20resize_390X347%20USP-22.jpg"
                    class="img-fluid imgAnimation" data-aos="fade" alt="Lodha Worli - Residential Property In Worli with Perfect Location" title="Lodha Worli - Perfect Location">
            </picture>
        </div>
        <div class="textDiv">
            <div class="ourPromiseTextDiv ContentText">
                <h2 class="headingH1" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">Where the city revolves around you</h2>
                <p data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200" class="">With virtually signal-free access to Nariman Point, Malabar Hill, BKC and Navi Mumbai through direct private access^ from the Worli-Sewri Connector, the city’s key destinations are always within easy reach.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="textImgDiv d-flex justify-content-between align-item-center">
        <div class="imgDiv">
            <picture>
				<source media="(min-width:767px)" srcset="/sites/default/files/2026-02/2588625822_Lodha_Worli_Images__Desktop_527_x_468-12.jpg" alt="Lodha Worli - Residential Property In Worli with Luxury Residences"  title="Lodha Worli - Luxury Residences">
                <img src="/sites/default/files/2026-02/2588625822_Lodha_Worli_Images__Mobile_390_x_347-13.jpg"
                    class="img-fluid imgAnimation" data-aos="fade" alt="Lodha Worli - Residential Property In Worli with Luxury Residences"  title="Lodha Worli - Luxury Residences">
                
            </picture>
        </div>
        <div class="textDiv">
            <div class="ourPromiseTextDiv ContentText">
                <h2 class="headingH1" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">A life, thoughtfully orchestrated</h2>
                <p data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200" class="">From the way spaces are planned to the quality of air within, every detail is considered. Each residence is designed to achieve an indoor air quality of AQI 65 or better, setting a new standard for healthier and more considered living in the heart of the city.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="textImgDiv d-flex justify-content-between align-item-center">
        <div class="imgDiv">
            <picture>
                <source media="(min-width:767px)" srcset="/sites/default/files/2026-02/2588625822_Lodha-Worli_Images-resize_SC_03_4.jpg" alt="Lodha Worli - Residential Property In Worli with Private Club" title="Lodha Worli - Private Club">
                <img src="/sites/default/files/2026-02/2588625822_Lodha-Worli_Images-resize_SC_03_5.jpg"
                    class="img-fluid imgAnimation" data-aos="fade" alt="Lodha Worli - Residential Property In Worli with Private Club" title="Lodha Worli - Private Club">
            </picture>
        </div>
        <div class="textDiv">
            <div class="ourPromiseTextDiv ContentText">
                <h2 class="headingH1" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">A private club at home</h2>
                <p data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200" class="">Over 1,00,000 sq. ft. of amenities and open spaces create a world designed entirely around you. From an expansive fitness and wellness center to an indoor pool, multiple sports courts and an elegant banquet space, the experience of a private club unfolds within your own address.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="textImgDiv d-flex justify-content-between align-item-center">
        <div class="imgDiv">
            <picture>
                <source media="(min-width:767px)" srcset="/sites/default/files/2026-02/2588625822_Lodha_Worli_Images_527X468_USP-34.jpg" alt="Lodha Worli - Residential Property In Worli with Open Nature" title="Lodha Worli - Open Nature">
                <img src="/sites/default/files/2026-02/2588625822_Lodha_Worli_Images_390X347_USP-35.jpg" 
                    class="img-fluid imgAnimation" data-aos="fade" alt="Lodha Worli - Residential Property In Worli with Open Nature" title="Lodha Worli - Open Nature">
            </picture>
        </div>
        <div class="textDiv">
            <div class="ourPromiseTextDiv ContentText">
                <h2 class="headingH1" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">An icon demands the best minds</h2>
                <p data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200" class="">Designed by SCDA, the visionaries behind Park Hyatt - Maldives, The Ritz Carlton - Shanghai and the Singapore Art Museum, your home reflects their most evolved expression of design. Open, deeply connected to nature, and shaped by light and air, every space is composed to evoke quiet grandeur.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
	
	 <div class="textImgDiv d-flex justify-content-between align-item-center">
        <div class="imgDiv">
            <picture>
                <source media="(min-width:767px)" srcset="/sites/default/files/2026-02/2588625822_Lodha-Worli_Images-resize_SC_01_4.jpg"  alt="Lodha Worli - Residential Property In Worli with Lodha Hospitality" title="Lodha Worli - Lodha Hospitality">
                <img src="/sites/default/files/2026-02/2588625822_Lodha-Worli_Images-resize_SC_01_5.jpg" 
                    class="img-fluid imgAnimation" data-aos="fade" alt="Lodha Worli - Residential Property In Worli with Lodha Hospitality" title="Lodha Worli - Lodha Hospitality">
            </picture>
        </div>
        <div class="textDiv">
            <div class="ourPromiseTextDiv ContentText">
                <h2 class="headingH1" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">Personalised service at every turn </h2>
                <p data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200" class="">Here, service is anticipatory and deeply personal. Delivered by Lodha’s in-house hospitality team, it brings the attentiveness of a five-star hotel into the comfort and privacy of your own home.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
	
    
</div>
			
